<title>AUSTRIA: Radex posts 91 mln ats '97 Q1 pretax loss.</title>
<headline>Radex posts 91 mln ats '97 Q1 pretax loss.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian fireproof material maker Radex-Heraklith on Tuesday reported a pretax loss of 91 million schillings for the first quarter of 1997, against a 55 million schilling loss in the year ago period.</p>
<p>However, the company said it expected an increase in earnings in 1997 after a significant rise last year.</p>
</text>
